# Test volume

Every test that can open the audio device sets the master volume to 10%.

- `gbtg-transition-tests` calls `pcm_set_master_volume(0.1f)` at the top of `main`.
- `gbtg --headless` runs are tests and use 10% instead of the config volume.
- A new test executable, or a new test mode that plays audio through some other
  path, must set 10% before the XAudio2 master voice is created.
